{"seq":2,"slug":"intelligent-systems-research","title":"智能系统前沿","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/engineering/intelligent-systems-research","introMarkdown":"# 智能系统前沿 简介\n\n智能系统是能够感知环境、自主决策并采取行动以实现预定目标的工程系统。从自动驾驶汽车到工业协作机器人，从智能电网到手术辅助系统，智能系统正在重塑工程实践的边界。博士阶段的智能系统研究不仅关注算法本身，更关注算法在物理世界中部署时面临的安全性、可解释性、实时性和人机协作等工程挑战。\n\n本知识库围绕三个前沿方向展开，覆盖智能系统从核心能力到部署落地的完整技术栈。\n\n第一章**自主系统**聚焦于具备独立决策能力的工程系统。内容涵盖多智能体协调与群体智能、不确定性下的机器人规划，以及自主系统的安全保障方法。这些主题从决策理论和控制论的交叉视角，探讨如何使工程系统在开放、动态的环境中可靠运行。\n\n第二章**人-AI 交互**关注智能系统与人类操作者之间的协作界面。内容包括面向工程应用的可解释人工智能、信任校准与共享自主，以及自适应人机编队。这些主题直接回应了\"人类如何与越来越自主的系统有效协作\"这一核心工程问题。\n\n第三章**边缘智能**探讨将 AI 推理能力推向资源受限设备的技术路径。内容涵盖模型压缩与边缘端神经架构搜索、联邦学习与隐私保护 AI，以及异构硬件上的实时推理。边缘智能是智能系统从云端走向现场部署的关键使能技术。\n\n建议学习路径为：先建立自主系统的决策与规划基础，再理解人机协作的交互设计原则，最后掌握边缘部署的工程约束与优化方法。三个方向相互关联——自主系统需要可解释性支持人类监督，边缘部署则为自主系统的实时决策提供硬件基础。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"autonomous-systems","title":"自主系统","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/engineering/intelligent-systems-research/autonomous-systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"multi-agent-coordination","title":"博士智能系统 — 多智能体协调与群体智能","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/engineering/intelligent-systems-research/autonomous-systems/multi-agent-coordination"},{"seq":2,"slug":"planning-under-uncertainty","title":"博士智能系统 — 不确定性下的机器人规划","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/engineering/intelligent-systems-research/autonomous-systems/planning-under-uncertainty"},{"seq":3,"slug":"safety-assurance","title":"博士智能系统 — 自主系统安全保障","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/engineering/intelligent-systems-research/autonomous-systems/safety-assurance"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"human-ai-interaction","title":"人-AI 交互","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/engineering/intelligent-systems-research/human-ai-interaction","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"explainable-ai-for-engineering","title":"博士智能系统 — 面向工程的可解释人工智能","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/engineering/intelligent-systems-research/human-ai-interaction/explainable-ai-for-engineering"},{"seq":2,"slug":"trust-calibration-shared-autonomy","title":"博士智能系统 — 信任校准与共享自主","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/engineering/intelligent-systems-research/human-ai-interaction/trust-calibration-shared-autonomy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"adaptive-human-machine-teaming","title":"博士智能系统 — 自适应人机编队","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/engineering/intelligent-systems-research/human-ai-interaction/adaptive-human-machine-teaming"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"edge-intelligence","title":"边缘智能","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/engineering/intelligent-systems-research/edge-intelligence","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"model-compression-and-nas","title":"博士智能系统 — 模型压缩与边缘神经架构搜索","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/engineering/intelligent-systems-research/edge-intelligence/model-compression-and-nas"},{"seq":2,"slug":"federated-learning-privacy","title":"博士智能系统 — 联邦学习与隐私保护 AI","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/engineering/intelligent-systems-research/edge-intelligence/federated-learning-privacy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"real-time-inference-hardware","title":"博士智能系统 — 异构硬件上的实时推理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/engineering/intelligent-systems-research/edge-intelligence/real-time-inference-hardware"}]}]}